    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Un hiver pire que jamais. Le gouvernement publie un d\u00e9cret obligeant les citoyens fran\u00e7ais les mieux log\u00e9s \u00e0 accueillir chez eux pendant la vague de froid leurs concitoyens en situation pr\u00e9caire. \u00c0 l\u2019heure du Grand Partage, un vent de panique s\u2019installe \u00e0 tous les \u00e9tages dans un immeuble tr\u00e8s chic de la capitale.",
        "english": "A winter that's worse than ever before. The government publishes a decree obliging the best housed French citizens to take in, during the cold snap, their fellow citizens living in precarious conditions. A l\u2019heure du Grand Partage, un vent de panique s\u2019installe \u00e0 tous les \u00e9tages dans un immeuble tr\u00e8s chic de la capitale. At the time of the Great Sharing, a wave of panic spreads to every floor of a very chic Parisian building."
